<title>USA: Renal Care adopts shareholder rights plan.</title>
<headline>Renal Care adopts shareholder rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Renal Care Group Inc said on Friday that its directors had adopted a shareholder rights plan to protect shareholders' interests should anyone seek control of the company.</p>
<p>The plan allows for one preferred stock purchase right to be distributed as a dividend on each outstanding share of Renal Care common stock held of record as of the close of business on June 2, the company said.</p>
